
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Explore | Verso Alto</title>

  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=DM+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700&family=Playfair+Display:wght@500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">

  <style>
    :root {
      --forest: #18352b;
      --cream: #f7f5ef;
      --sage: #657b62;
    }

    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
    }

    body {
      margin: 0;
      background: var(--cream);
      color: var(--forest);
      font-family: "DM Sans", sans-serif;
    }

    .container {
      width: min(1100px, 92%);
      margin: auto;
    }

    .navbar {
      border-bottom: 1px solid #dce2da;
    }

    .nav-inner {
      min-height: 82px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 24px;
    }

    .logo {
      font-family: "Playfair Display", serif;
      font-size: 1.35rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: 0.05em;
      text-decoration: none;
    }

    .nav-links {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 25px;
    }

    .nav-links a {
      color: var(--forest);
      text-decoration: none;
      font-weight: 600;
    }

    .nav-links a:hover {
      color: var(--sage);
    }

    .hero {
      padding: 75px 0 45px;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .eyebrow {
      color: var(--sage);
      font-size: 0.78rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: 0.15em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    h1, h2 {
      font-family: "Playfair Display", serif;
    }

    h1 {
      margin: 18px 0;
      font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 6vw, 4.5rem);
      line-height: 1.1;
    }

    .intro {
      max-width: 650px;
      margin: auto;
      line-height: 1.8;
      color: #53645a;
    }

    .search-section {
      padding: 25px 0 85px;
    }

    .search-card {
      max-width: 950px;
      margin: auto;
      padding: 35px;
      background: white;
      border: 1px solid #dce2da;
      border-radius: 16px;
      box-shadow: 0 12px 35px #18352b0d;
    }

    .search-card h2 {
      margin-top: 0;
      font-size: 2rem;
    }

    .search-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
      gap: 20px;
    }

    .field {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 8px;
    }

    label {
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      font-weight: 700;
    }

    input, select {
      width: 100%;
      min-height: 48px;
      padding: 12px;
      border: 1px solid #cfd8ce;
      border-radius: 8px;
      background: white;
      color: var(--forest);
      font: inherit;
    }

    button {
      width: 100%;
      min-height: 50px;
      margin-top: 24px;
      border: 0;
      border-radius: 8px;
      background: var(--forest);
      color: white;
      font: inherit;
      font-weight: 700;
      cursor: pointer;
    }

    button:hover {
      background: var(--sage);
    }

    .note {
      color: #647168;
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      line-height: 1.6;
      text-align: center;
    }

    footer {
      padding: 30px 0;
      background: var(--forest);
      color: var(--cream);
      text-align: center;
    }

    @media (max-width: 650px) {
      .nav-inner {
        align-items: flex-start;
        flex-direction: column;
        padding: 18px 0;
      }

      .nav-links {
        gap: 18px;
      }

      .hero {
        padding: 55px 0 35px;
      }

      .search-card {
        padding: 22px 18px;
      }

      .search-grid {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>
  <header class="navbar">
    <nav class="nav-inner container">
      <a class="logo" href="index.html">VERSO ALTO</a>

      <div class="nav-links">
        <a href="index.html">Home</a>
        <a href="explore.html">Explore</a>
        <a href="community.html">Community</a>
      </div>
    </nav>
  </header>

  <main>
    <section class="hero">
      <div class="container">
        <p class="eyebrow">Find your next adventure</p>
        <h1>Explore Further.<br>Go Higher.</h1>
        <p class="intro">
          Discover hiking trails, mountain views, and outdoor adventures
          across the United States. Find a destination that inspires you
          to get outside and explore.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="search-section" id="find-adventures">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="search-card">
          <h2>Find an Adventure</h2>

          <form action="explore.html" method="get">
            <div class="search-grid">
              <div class="field">
                <label for="destination">State or destination</label>
                <input id="destination" name="destination" type="text" placeholder="e.g. North Carolina">
              </div>

              <div class="field">
                <label for="difficulty">Difficulty</label>
                <select id="difficulty" name="difficulty">
                  <option value="">Any difficulty</option>
                  <option value="easy">Easy</option>
                  <option value="moderate">Moderate</option>
                  <option value="hard">Hard</option>
                  <option value="strenuous">Strenuous</option>
                </select>
              </div>

              <div class="field">
                <label for="distance">Trail distance</label>
                <select id="distance" name="distance">
                  <option value="">Any distance</option>
                  <option value="0-3">0–3 miles</option>
                  <option value="3-6">3–6 miles</option>
                  <option value="6-10">6–10 miles</option>
                  <option value="10-plus">10+ miles</option>
                </select>
              </div>

              <div class="field">
                <label for="type">Adventure type</label>
                <select id="type" name="type">
                  <option value="">All adventures</option>
                  <option value="hiking">Hiking</option>
                  <option value="mountain">Mountain views</option>
                  <option value="camping">Camping</option>
                  <option value="backpacking">Backpacking</option>
                </select>
              </div>
            </div>

            <button type="submit">Search Adventures</button>
            <p class="note">
              We're building our adventure collection. Actual trail results
              will be connected as the site develops.
            </p>
          </form>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <footer>
    <div class="container">Verso Alto — Explore further. Go higher.</div>
  </footer>
</body>
</html>
